SCOPE
=====
This file applies to the contents of the clanverse-character-emojis directory,
including copies distributed in the pack ZIP. It does not relicense the parent
Clanverse application or unrelated repository files.

The two licenses below apply to different material. They are NOT alternative
licenses from which a recipient may choose for the same material.

1. MIT applies strictly to the project-authored Python engineering tools
   (*.py files), including export-pack.py, package-pack.py, read-catalog.py,
   add_watermark.py, validate-pack.py, and test_tools.py.
2. CC BY-NC 4.0 applies to the contributor-owned graphic assets and supporting
   non-Python material in this directory: the complete archer/ and barbarian/
   directories; all PNGs, original master images, SVGs and embedded artwork;
   previews and progress boards; and project-authored documentation, JSON
   metadata, and configuration text. A directory's asset scope does not change
   the MIT scope of any project-authored Python tool it may contain.
3. A mixed archive retains these per-file terms. An MIT-licensed tool does not
   confer MIT rights on the artwork it reads, creates, exports, or packages.
   Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses and are not relicensed.

